# Frontend configuration (Vite). Copy to .env to override.
#
# Leave empty to use the same-origin /api path. The dev and preview servers
# proxy /api to http://127.0.0.1:8787 (override with POSI_API_URL when running
# `npm run dev`). When the built app is hosted on static hosting, point this at
# the deployed API, which must allow this site's origin via CORS_ORIGINS.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
